  - {fileID: 4927439641625005226}
  _nameBox: {fileID: 6795640555900239473}
  _descriptionBox: {fileID: 227877081888687551}
  DescriptionBarks:
  - "Take as much time as you need\u2026."
  - Are you making an impulse buy?
  - "If you could wait, while I get that from the back\u2026."
  - Good things come to those who wait.
  - "Don\u2019t spend beyond your means\u2026."
  - 'On sale? No. Nothing is on sale here. '
  - Does anybody really know what time it is?
  - Time is a construct. Wares are forever.
  - I hear inflation is pretty bad, not that it matters here.
  - "Toss a coin to your Watcher\u2026."
  - "I\u2019m waiting\u2026. "
  - "I\u2019ll wait\u2026. "
  _selectedItem: {fileID: 0}
